#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:health_fieldservice.action_health_ai_assignment_engine
msgid ""
"The AI Assignment Engine uses machine learning to optimize staff assignments,\n"
"                improve efficiency, and balance workloads. Train the AI model with historical\n"
